  "conversionNotes": [
    "No d6 'roll of X' wording in the special rules; no dice conversions needed. Prayers of Taal are a D6 table with difficulties (Stag's Leap 7, Blessed Ale 5, Bear's Paw 7, Earthshudder 9, Tanglefoot 8, Summon Squirrels 7); the table itself is not recorded here.",
    "Warband-wide special skill table 'Special' = Ostlander Special Skills (Bull Rush, Foul Odour, Taunt, Animal Friendship, Blood Oath).",
    "Ogre is listed as 0-1 in the Henchmen section; the PDF's Choice of Warriors says 'one Ogre'. Max 1, so group size is 1. Ogre can become a Hero via The Lad's Got Talent.",
    "Ostlander profile maximums (p.41, not recorded in fields): Human M4 WS6 BS6 S4 T4 W3 I6 A4 Ld9; Ogre M6 WS5 BS4 S6 T6 W4 I5 A4 Ld7 (scan is small, verify).",
    "New equipment: Double-barrelled Pistol (30 gc, 60 per brace, Av Rare 10) and Double-barrelled Hunting rifle (300 gc, Av Rare 12); each hit is two blasts, each barrel takes a full turn to reload. Jaeger equipment list prints Hunting rifle at 200 gc.",
    "Item names: Ostlander list prints 'Double-handed Weapon' (capital W) and 'Mace/hammer'; Jaeger list items copied as printed.",
    "Elder skills per table: Combat, Shooting, Strength, Speed, Special; Blood Brother: Combat, Strength, Special; Priest: Combat, Academic, Strength, Speed, Special."
  ]
